      sections: {"summary":"The system MUST record and track payments received from or owed to clients.","goals":"### Goals\n\nNot yet defined.\n\n### Non-Goals\n\nNot yet defined.","actors":"| Actor | Description |\n|---|---|\n| Owner | Full control over this capability |\n| Admin | Administrative access |\n| Team Member | Internal user with scoped access |\n| Consultant | External specialist with limited access |\n| Client Portal User | External client with restricted view |\n| AI Agent | Automated AI operations |","useCases":"### UC-01 — Not yet defined\n\n| Item | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Actor | Not yet defined. |\n| Goal | Not yet defined. |\n| Main Flow | Not yet defined. |\n| System Response | Not yet defined. |\n| Alternate Flow | Not yet defined. |","scope":"### MVP Scope\n\nNot yet defined.\n\n### Future Scope\n\nNot yet defined.","features":"| ID | Feature | Status | Description |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| F01 | 🔴 Features not yet defined | 🔴 Not Defined | Use this PRD template to complete this capability document. |","businessRules":"### Business Rules\n\n### 5.1 Not yet defined\n\n| Rule | Behavior |\n|---|---|\n\n### Edge Cases / Scenarios\n\n| Scenario | Expected Behavior |\n|---|---|","fieldSpec":"| Field | Type | Required | Constraints / Rules | Notes |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|","permissions":"| Role | Create | View | Edit | Delete | Archive | Export | Share | AI Access |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Owner | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n| Admin | Yes | Yes | Yes | Limited | Yes | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n| Team Member | Yes | Scoped | Scoped | No | Maybe | Maybe | No | Scoped |\n| Consultant | Maybe | Assigned | Limited | No | No | No | No | Limited |\n| Client Portal | No | Client-visible | Limited | No | No | Maybe | No | Limited |","uiUx":"### 10.1 Screens\n\n| Screen | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n\n### 10.2 Components / Widgets\n\n| Component | Purpose |\n|---|---|","workflows":"| Operation | Required Behavior | Shared/Core Handling |\n|---|---|---|\n| Create | Not yet defined. | |\n| Edit | Not yet defined. | |\n| Delete | Not yet defined. | |\n| Search | Not yet defined. | |","api":"### Modules\n\n### 11.1 Server / Core Application Layer\n\n| Module | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n\n### 11.2 Browser Extension Layer\n\n| Module | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n\n### 11.3 Web / Desktop Layer\n\n| Module | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n\n### 11.4 Mobile Layer\n\n| Module | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n\n### 11.5 Shared / Infrastructure Layer\n\n| Module | Responsibility |\n|---|---|","ai":"| Enabler | Purpose |\n|---|---|","oss":"1. Not yet defined.","integrations":"### Depends On\n\n| Capability / Module | Why it is needed |\n|---|---|\n\n### Depended On By\n\n| Capability / Module | Why it depends on this capability |\n|---|---|\n\n### Related Capabilities\n\n| Capability | Relationship |\n|---|---|","nfr":"### Performance\n\nNot yet defined.\n\n### Accessibility\n\nNot yet defined.\n\n### Security / Privacy\n\nNot yet defined.","openQuestions":"| Question | Status | Notes |\n|---|---:|---|","risks":"### Risks\n\nNot yet defined.\n\n### Decisions Made\n\nNot yet defined.","testing":"### Acceptance Criteria\n\nNot yet defined.\n\n### Testing Requirements\n\nNot yet defined.","readiness":"```\n[ ] PRD sections 1-27 complete\n[ ] Data model approved\n[ ] Field-level spec complete\n[ ] Schema drafted\n[ ] Permissions matrix approved\n[ ] API contract drafted\n[ ] UI skeleton approved\n[ ] Workflow rules documented\n[ ] OSS decision finalized\n[ ] Integration map confirmed both directions\n[ ] AI/search rules defined\n[ ] Notification/activity rules defined\n[ ] Security/privacy rules defined\n[ ] Edge cases documented\n[ ] Acceptance criteria written\n[ ] Testing requirements written\n[ ] Performance requirements defined\n[ ] MVP/future scope separated\n[ ] Open questions resolved or deferred\n[ ] Risks documented\n[ ] Decisions recorded\n```"},
